{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10127040","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10127040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:5:1012704001:0":{"text":"어서요! 제게 힘을 주겠다고 약속했잖습니까! 반드시 저 녀석들을 없애야겠어요!","source_cn":"快！你答应过，要给我力量！我一定要打败那些混蛋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CF8DB6972D237C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012704002:0":{"text":"내가 무슨 빚이라도 진 것처럼 말하는군. 이건 분명 거래였는데.","source_cn":"说得像是我亏欠你似的，这明明是我们的交易。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6E3CD0048DCA358","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012704003:0":{"text":"그래도 무언가를 얻기는 했으니... 좋아, 네 소원을 들어주지.","source_cn":"看在我有所收获的份上……好吧，我可以实现你的愿望。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EEE1DE9AB335811","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:9:1012724:0":{"text":"남쪽 언덕 마을에서 사라졌던 여인이 다시 모습을 드러내자, 이미르는 또다시 그녀와 실랑이를 벌였다.","source_cn":"在南坡村消失的那位女士再次出现，伊米尔又一次和她产生了争执。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6AC2AAB2B351EE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊米尔":{"text":"이미르","source":"伊米尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伊露西卡":{"text":"이루시카","source":"伊露西卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}